Names beginning `roux_old_` are roux's, for a table set aside while it is
rebuilt: schema.sql may not use one.

== before
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY) STRICT;

== after
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY) STRICT;
CREATE TABLE roux_old_dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY) STRICT;

== error
`roux_old_dish`: names starting `roux_old_` are roux's, for rebuilding
